# Security rules

See `packages/core/standards/security.md`.

Highlights:
- Never commit secrets. Rotate any secret that touched the repo.
- Validate every input with a schema; reject unknown fields.
- Parameterized queries always.
- Auth/authz on every endpoint, not only at the gateway.
- CSRF, CSP, security headers configured.
- Mask PII in logs.
